<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25856" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασκοπέω</span></b>  (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασκέπτομαι</span>), fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασκέψομαι</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεσκεψάμην</span>: pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέσκεμμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					836
				</span></i>
			, but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεσκέφθαι</span> in
			pass.sense, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Th.</u>
				687
			</span></i>:— <i>look at in different ways, examine</i> or
				<i>consider well,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				557
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑξῆς δ. τὸν λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					350e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tht.</u>
				168e
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πρὸς ἑαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Chrm.</u>
					160e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ σφᾶς αὐτούς, περί τινος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				61e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. περί τινος εἰ . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1272a26
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἑαυτῶν ἀσφαλείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					58.7
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὰ ἔξω διασκοπεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.59
				</span></i>
			: impf., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				259c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs.,
				<i>look round one, keep watching,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ ὁρῶνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					9.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
